SUMMARY:Deadline 18:00 Hong Kong time: HKADC Cultural Exchange Project Gran
 t (up to HKD 500\,000 for Hong Kong artists working abroad)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 31 Dec 2026 at 18:00 Hong Kong time.\n\nThe Hong Kong Ar
 ts Development Council's Cultural Exchange Project Grant supports Hong Kon
 g artists and arts organisations taking work abroad: overseas exhibitions\
 , performances\, festival participation\, residencies\, touring and simila
 r exchange activity\, across music\, dance\, xiqu\, drama\, visual arts\, 
 literary arts\, film and media arts (each including multi-disciplinary wor
 k) and arts...\n\nOrganisation: Hong Kong Arts Development Council (HKADC)
 \nLocation: Exchange activities held outside Hong Kong. Individual applica
 nts must hold a Hong Kong identity card\; organisations must be registered
  in Hong Kong.\nAward: General Version: up to HKD 500\,000 for individual 
 artists and arts organisations\, covering all project expenditure except l
 isted exclusions\; up to HKD 800\,000 for experienced organisations with l
 arge-scale\, outstanding exchange projects. Trial Version: up to HKD 150\,
 000 for transportation\, freight\, insurance and documentation only. No ap
 plication fee stated.\nDuration: Per project\n\nMore: https://www.hkadc.or
 g.hk/en/grants-and-scholarship/grants/project-grant?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.hkadc.org.hk/en/grants-and-scholarship/grants/project-grant
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Exchange activities held outside Hong Kong. Individual applicants 
 must hold a Hong Kong identity card\; organisations must be registered in 
 Hong Kong.
END:VEVENT
