SUMMARY:Deadline: Sixi Museum: SIXI AiR Open Call 2027 Spring & Autumn (Nan
 jing)
DESCRIPTION:The Sixi International Artist-in-Residence Project\, run by Six
 i Museum in Nanjing since 2024\, selects 4 artists across two three-month 
 sessions in 2027 (Spring\, March to May\, and Autumn\, September to Novemb
 er).\n\nOrganisation: Sixi Museum\nLocation: Nanjing\, China. Open to arti
 sts of all disciplines and cultural backgrounds\, aged 18 or older\, profi
 cient in Mandarin or English.\nAward: Round-trip flights\, visa applicatio
 n fees\, insurance\, and a private city-center apartment or loft studio on
  the outskirts\, plus a material allowance (amount not published)\, techni
 cal assistance\, airport pickup and translation support. NO artist fee or 
 stipend mentioned. No application fee.\nDuration: Three months: Spring 202
 7 (March to May) or Autumn 2027 (September to November).\n\nMore: https://
 siximuseum.com/en/residency/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_med
 ium=referral
