SUMMARY:Deadline: 4th Matsu Biennial International Open Call (Matsu Islands
 \, Taiwan)
DESCRIPTION:The 4th Matsu Biennial invites artists and creative teams world
 wide to develop new work for the Matsu Islands\, Taiwan\, taking the archi
 pelago itself as its site: its geography\, Cold War history\, marine ecolo
 gy and everyday life.\n\nOrganisation: Matsu Biennial Promotion Committee 
 (Lienchiang County Government and General Association of Chinese Culture)\
 nLocation: Matsu Islands (Nangan\, Beigan\, Dongju\, Xiju)\, Taiwan. Open 
 to individual artists\, creative practitioners and artist teams of any nat
 ionality\, aged 18 and over.\nAward: 4 to 5 proposals are selected\; each 
 in principle receives NTD 800\,000 (approximately USD 25\,000\, tax includ
 ed) in financial support.\nDuration: Selected works must be completed by 1
 0 August 2027\; exhibition planned 20 August to 7 November 2027\n\nMore: h
 ttps://matsubiennial.tw/en/news/details/88?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://matsubiennial.tw/en/news/details/88?utm_source=artificialnouvea
 ugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Matsu Islands (Nangan\, Beigan\, Dongju\, Xiju)\, Taiwan. Open to 
 individual artists\, creative practitioners and artist teams of any nation
 ality\, aged 18 and over.
END:VEVENT
